   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85261-43E.recto.2_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0048_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>bhṭybʾl Y PWN dsṭkrṭ' Y
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>wndʾṭbwlcmṭrʾp̄ʾṭ' dʾlyk MN ẔK
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ʿL bwn' ẔNH BYRḤ whwmn' Y ŠNṬ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>$$-IIII-IIII HLYʾ $-X dwlk'
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>ʿL mhsṭ-lṭ' YḤBWNṭ' W ck'
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>ʾclmykdwhṭ' ḤṬYMWNṭ ○○○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0048_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Baxtiyār ī pad dastgird ī
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>Windādburzmihr-ābād dārīg az ān ī
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ō bun ēn māh Wahman ī sāl
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>48 sik 30 dōlag
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ō mahist-rad dād ud čak
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>Āzarmīgduxt āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0048_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Baxtiyār, manager of the estate of
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>Windādburzmihr-ābād, from that which
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>(belongs) to the bun, this month Wahman (11th month) of the year
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>48, gave (line 5) 30 dōlag of vinegar
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>to the Chief Rad, and Āzarmīgduxt sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
